WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
Desktop Web: browse recommendations across sources
and expand a recommendation's explanation.

00:10.000 --> 00:20.000
Browser extension: scroll through recommendations,
with explanations and a shared library.

00:20.000 --> 00:30.000
Mobile Web: like a recommendation.
The same backend keeps your saved content together.

00:30.000 --> 00:40.000
Profile: inspect how the agent understands you.
Existing screenshot; model inferences can be corrected.

00:40.000 --> 00:48.000
Content taste: cognitive style, pace, and depth preferences.
Existing interface screenshot.

00:48.000 --> 00:57.000
Interest probes: respond to a new direction.
Existing interface screenshot.

00:57.000 --> 01:05.000
Chat: discuss content and share your preferences.
Existing interface screenshot.

01:05.000 --> 01:10.000
Library: return to content saved for later.
Desktop, extension, and mobile connect to the same backend.
